tle": "Steve Explains Item #3"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 29, "text": "", "title": "Steve Explains Item #1", "metadata": {"title": "Steve Explains Item #1"}, "sections": []}]}, {"id": 30, "text": "", "title": "Skeptical Quote of the Week", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:42:11", "hour": "1", "minute": "42", "second": "11", "title": "Skeptical Quote of the Week"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 31, "text": "", "title": "Signoff/Announcements", "metadata": {"timestamp": "1:42:59", "hour": "1", "minute": "42", "second": "59", "title": "Signoff/Announcements"}, "sections": [{"id": 32, "text": "\u2014and until next week, this is your  Skeptics' Guide to the Universe.", "metadata": {"speaker_abbreviation": "S", "speaker": "Steven Novella"}}, {"id": 33, "text": "The Skeptics' Guide to the Universe is produced by SGU Productions, dedicated to promoting science and critical thinking. For more information on this and other episodes, please visit our website at theskepticsguide.org, where you will find the show notes as well as links to our blogs, videos, online forum, and other content. You can send us feedback or questions to info@theskepticsguide.org. Also, please consider supporting the SGU by visiting the store page on our website, where you will find merchandise, premium content, and subscription information. Our listeners are what make SGU possible.", "metadata": {"links": ["http://www.theskepticsguide.org", "https://www.theskepticsguide.org/shop"], "speaker_abbreviation": "S", "speaker": "Steven Novella"}}]}, {"id": 34, "text": "", "title": "Today I Learned", "metadata": {"title": "Today I Learned"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 35, "text": "", "title": "Notes", "metadata": {"title": "Notes"}, "sections": []}, {"id": 36, "text": "\n\u2191 Toronto Botanical Garden: Botanical Nerd Word: Vagile\n\n\u2191 Perf Science: NASA\u2019s Hammer Spacecraft aiming to divert asteroid from hitting our planet\n\n\u2191 Neurologica: Gullible Reporting About ESP on CBS\n\n\u2191 Neurologica: Free Speec